<title>USA: CitFed stockholders approve share increase.</title>
<headline>CitFed stockholders approve share increase.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>CitFed Bancorp Inc said Friday its stockholders approved a proposal to amend the corporation's certificate of incorporation, increasing the number of authorized shares of common stock to 20 million.</p>
</text>
